{
  "kind": "html",
  "caption": "对每个节点做后序遍历：先得到左右子树向下延伸的最大节点数，再用“左深度 + 右深度”更新直径。节点向父节点返回 `1 + max(左深度, 右深度)`，但全局答案保留所有节点产生的最大路径。示例中根节点 1 产生候选长度 3，对应路径 4→2→1→3（也可从 5 出发）。",
  "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>二叉树的直径</title>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body{ margin: 0; background: #1c1c1c; color: #d4d4d4; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; font-size: 15px; }\n  body{ padding: 24px; }\n  main{ width: 100%; max-width: 980px; margin: 0 auto; display: grid; gap: 20px; }\n  .panel { background: #252526; border: 1px solid #3c3c3c; border-radius: 10px; padding: 20px; }\n  h1 { margin: 0 0 10px; font-size: 22px; color: #fff; }\n  p { margin: 0; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .mono, .value, .metric strong, .formula { font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; }\n  .tree { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(72px, 1fr)); grid-template-areas: \". n1 n1 .\" \"e12 e12 e13 e13\" \"n2 n2 n3 n3\" \"e24 e25 . .\" \"n4 n5 . .\"; gap: 12px 18px; align-items: stretch; margin-top: 18px; }\n  .node { min-height: 82px; border: 2px solid #555; border-radius: 9px; background: #2d2d30; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 5px; transition: background .35s, border-color .35s, color .35s; }\n  .node .value { font-size: 22px; color: #fff; }\n  .node .note { font-size: 13px; color: #9da1a6; text-align: center; min-height: 19px; }\n  .node.active { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .node.done { border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .node.path { background: #0e639c; border-color: #3794ff; }\n  .edge { color: #777; text-align: center; font-family: \"SF Mono\", Monaco, Menlo, monospace; line-height: 22px; transition: color .35s; }\n  .edge.path { color: #3794ff; font-weight: 700; }\n  #n1 { grid-area: n1; } #n2 { grid-area: n2; } #n3 { grid-area: n3; } #n4 { grid-area: n4; } #n5 { grid-area: n5; }\n  #e12 { grid-area: e12; } #e13 { grid-area: e13; } #e24 { grid-area: e24; } #e25 { grid-area: e25; }\n  .status { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(120px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }\n  .metric { background: #2d2d30; border: 1px solid #444; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .metric span { display: block; color: #9da1a6; font-size: 13px; }\n  .metric strong { color: #3794ff; font-size: 19px; }\n  .explain { min-height: 78px; margin-top: 16px; padding: 14px; border-left: 4px solid #3794ff; background: #2d2d30; line-height: 1.7; }\n  .formula { color: #fff; }\n  .legend { margin-top: 14px; color: #9da1a6; font-size: 13px; }\n  @media (max-width: 620px) {\n    body{ padding: 14px; }\n    .panel { padding: 15px; }\n    .tree { grid-template-columns: repeat(4, minmax(48px, 1fr)); gap: 10px 8px; }\n    .status { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n  /* COMPACT */ html,body{font-size:12px!important;line-height:1.45!important}body{padding:8px 10px 10px!important}main{max-width:560px!important;gap:8px!important}.panel{padding:8px 10px!important;border-radius:6px!important;border:1px solid #3c3c3c!important}h1{font-size:14px!important;margin:0 0 4px!important;color:#d4d4d4!important}p{font-size:12px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.tree{gap:6px 8px!important;margin-top:8px!important}.node{min-height:52px!important;padding:6px!important;border-width:1px!important;border-radius:6px!important}.node .value{font-size:13px!important}.node .note{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important;min-height:auto!important}.status{grid-template-columns:1fr!important;gap:6px!important}.metric{padding:8px 10px!important;font-size:12px!important}.metric span{font-size:10px!important;color:#8d8d8d!important}.metric strong{font-size:13px!important}.explain{border-left-width:3px!important;padding:8px 10px!important;margin-top:8px!important;min-height:auto!important;font-size:12px!important}.legend{font-size:10px!important;margin-top:8px!important}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <h1>示例树 <span class=\"mono\">[1,2,3,4,5]</span></h1>\n    <p>蓝色节点是当前后序遍历到的位置；节点内部记录它向父节点返回的深度。</p>\n    <div class=\"tree\" aria-label=\"示例二叉树\">\n      <div class=\"node\" id=\"n1\"><div class=\"value\">1</div><div class=\"note\">等待子树</div></div>\n      <div class=\"edge\" id=\"e12\">╱ 左边</div>\n      <div class=\"edge\" id=\"e13\">右边 ╲</div>\n      <div class=\"node\" id=\"n2\"><div class=\"value\">2</div><div class=\"note\">等待子树</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node\" id=\"n3\"><div class=\"value\">3</div><div class=\"note\">等待处理</div></div>\n      <div class=\"edge\" id=\"e24\">╱ 左边</div>\n      <div class=\"edge\" id=\"e25\">右边 ╲</div>\n      <div class=\"node\" id=\"n4\"><div class=\"value\">4</div><div class=\"note\">等待处理</div></div>\n      <div class=\"node\" id=\"n5\"><div class=\"value\">5</div><div class=\"note\">等待处理</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\">\n    <div class=\"status\">\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>当前节点</span><strong id=\"current\">4</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>当前候选直径</span><strong id=\"candidate\">0 + 0 = 0</strong></div>\n      <div class=\"metric\"><span>全局最大直径</span><strong id=\"answer\">0</strong></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"explain\" id=\"explain\"></div>\n    <div class=\"legend\">深度按节点数计算，因此穿过当前节点的边数恰好是 <span class=\"formula\">左深度 + 右深度</span>。</div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const steps = [\n    { id: 'n4', current: '4', candidate: '0 + 0 = 0', answer: '0', depth: '返回深度 1', text: '节点 4 是叶子：左右深度都为 0，候选直径为 0，向上返回深度 1。' },\n    { id: 'n5', current: '5', candidate: '0 + 0 = 0', answer: '0', depth: '返回深度 1', text: '节点 5 同样是叶子，向节点 2 返回深度 1。' },\n    { id: 'n2', current: '2', candidate: '1 + 1 = 2', answer: '2', depth: '返回深度 2', text: '节点 2 汇总两个叶子：穿过它的路径有 2 条边；向上只选择更深的一侧，返回 2。' },\n    { id: 'n3', current: '3', candidate: '0 + 0 = 0', answer: '2', depth: '返回深度 1', text: '节点 3 是叶子，候选值 0 不会改写已有最大直径 2。' },\n    { id: 'n1', current: '1', candidate: '2 + 1 = 3', answer: '3', depth: '返回深度 3', text: '根节点 1 得到左深度 2、右深度 1，形成 3 条边的路径，全局答案更新为 3。', final: true }\n  ];\n  let index = 0;\n  const notes = {};\n\n  function render(step) {\n    document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('active', 'path'));\n    document.querySelectorAll('.edge').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('path'));\n    const node = document.getElementById(step.id);\n    node.classList.add('active');\n    node.classList.add('done');\n    notes[step.id] = step.depth;\n    Object.entries(notes).forEach(([id, text]) => {\n      document.querySelector('#' + id + ' .note').textContent = text;\n    });\n    document.getElementById('current').textContent = step.current;\n    document.getElementById('candidate').textContent = step.candidate;\n    document.getElementById('answer').textContent = step.answer;\n    document.getElementById('explain').textContent = step.text;\n    if (step.final) {\n      ['n4', 'n2', 'n1', 'n3'].forEach(id => document.getElementById(id).classList.add('path'));\n      ['e24', 'e12', 'e13'].forEach(id => document.getElementById(id).classList.add('path'));\n    }\n  }\n\n  function reset() {\n    Object.keys(notes).forEach(key => delete notes[key]);\n    document.querySelectorAll('.node').forEach(el => {\n      el.classList.remove('active', 'done', 'path');\n      el.querySelector('.note').textContent = el.id === 'n1' || el.id === 'n2' ? '等待子树' : '等待处理';\n    });\n    document.querySelectorAll('.edge').forEach(el => el.classList.remove('path'));\n  }\n\n  render(steps[0]);\n  setInterval(() => {\n    index = (index + 1) % steps.length;\n    if (index === 0) reset();\n    render(steps[index]);\n  }, 2200);\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>",
  "svg": "",
  "media": "",
  "time_complexity": "O(n)",
  "space_complexity": "O(h)",
  "complexity_note": "n 是节点数, h 是树高. 后序遍历同时返回深度并更新直径, 每个节点处理一次; 递归栈最坏 O(n), 无需保存每个节点的深度表."
}
